# Job Number timeline (Admin)

Owner-only `/job-timeline?job=`. Typed search. No Job Number catalog.

## Workspace

JTE-01–05 shipped. JTE-06 and JTE-07 stay deferred. Do not start
JTE-06/07 without recorded write / source-assurance approval. Do not
create `/daily`.
Orientation: [`uxdocs/HANDOFF-job-timeline-enhancement.md`](../../uxdocs/HANDOFF-job-timeline-enhancement.md).
Issues live in `vantage-main-server/docs/job-number-timeline/`.

## Render, do not evaluate

The server is the only evaluator. Admin copies DTO types additively into
`lib/api/jobNumberTimeline.ts`. Admin types are never the semantic
authority. Display `current_outcome`, `stage_assessments`, `attention`,
and `limitations` as given.

Shipped v2 hierarchy (`schema_version: "job_timeline.v2"`):

1. Typed search
2. Identity + `summary.headline` outcome
3. Stage strip from `stage_assessments`
4. Attention panel only if `attention.length > 0`
5. Oldest-first 21st clustered spine
6. Collapsed Proof boundaries from `limitations`

Density `?view=` (`lifecycle` default, `all`, `attention`, `customer`,
`system`) hides rows only. Header counts stay stable. `view` is not in
`queryKeys.jobNumberTimeline`.

Official Booking and official Cancellation stay independently visible
(never clustered). Activity groups must not drop events.

v1 fixtures remain renderable when `schema_version` is missing.
`coverage-chips.tsx` and `timeline.tsx` (nyxbui Timeline 1074) are that
fallback only. Do not treat nyxbui 1074 as the v2 story. v2 uses the
activity-clustered spine in `owner-timeline.tsx`
(https://21st.dev/ai/6e776855-13dc-4091-bdd5-dc4562e66466).

Sheet `synced` is outbox completion. Quote the server
`GOOGLE_DESTINATION_UNVERIFIED` label. Never “Sheet verified”.

This folder mounts `JobTimelinePage` from
`GET /api/v1/admin/job-number-timeline`. Do not mount forensic
`components/granot-lifecycle/job-timeline.tsx` on the Owner page.
`intake-reference.tsx` keeps the forensic drawer **and** the Owner
deep link.

## Deep links (JTE-05 shipped)

`JobTimelineDeepLink` uses existing `buildJobTimelineHref({ job })` →
`/job-timeline?job=`. Empty job renders `-`. Owner-only call sites:
Lead / Booking / Cancellation list and detail in
`operational-resource-page.tsx` (Form Leads gained a Job column when
`job_no` is present); intake list “Open Job timeline” in addition to
forensic “Open job history”; booking/cancellation workbench headline
Job Number; intake-reference “Open Job timeline”. No catalog. No
contact search. No employee/non-Owner links. Home
`OverviewJobTimelineLink`, sidebar, and Granot nav stay as they were.

JTE-05 certified the shipped JTE-04 page (screen-reader names on
outcome, attention count, evidence, proof boundaries; stage strip
state in aria-label + sr-only; density radiogroup without roving
tabindex). Admin still does not recompute server arrays.

## Invariants

- Keep `buildJobTimelineHref` / `?job=` as shareable state. `view` is
  additive only.
- Keep `queryKeys.jobNumberTimeline` isolated from `granotLifecycle`.
- v1 fixtures remain renderable while `schema_version` is absent.
- Locked headlines stay locked. No raw JSON. No contact.
- Sheet `synced` is never “Google verified”.
- Owner-only at `OWNER_ONLY_PAGE_PREFIXES` and `canProxyVantagePath`.
- Route, Owner gates, and proxy path stay unchanged.
